        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "銃兵　八小隊三百八十人　但し小隊人員四十人、中隊八十人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Riflemen: eight platoons, 380 men, with a two-line interlinear note giving platoon strength as 40 men and company strength as 80. The note is set as a pair of narrow columns whose lower figures are aligned, the left column leaving two glyph slots blank where the right column reads 人員. The source does not reconcile here: eight platoons of 40 would be 320, not the 380 printed. This is the leftmost column on the page, and Kikuma's military return continues on the facing page, where the four cannon, twenty-four gunners and fifteen supernumerary officers recorded in the project dataset are printed. MASTER's platoon note of 四十八人 is a low-resolution merge of the 四十 in the right column with the 八十 in the left; at high magnification the two columns are distinct."
      },
      {
